{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e-o250","title":"李孚请自往，将三骑入邺，尚从其计","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-e8fa3728cc4949d270c9","label":"裴注·魏略列传","text":"李孚请自往，将三骑入邺，尚从其计","evidence":["liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c"]},{"id":"liusima-a-31b4382970aa7c45a301","label":"裴注·魏略列传","text":"李孚辞尚南行，斫问事杖系马，著平上帻将三骑投暮诣邺下","evidence":["liusima-q-9aba3f6aab70ac54b164"]},{"id":"liusima-a-3959007a77dfdecd7b57","label":"裴注·魏略列传","text":"李孚自称都督夜历围，呵责守围将士行其罚","evidence":["liusima-q-b95e43771dc2d45e3569"]},{"id":"liusima-a-5d24c8c4de51ebcbe999","label":"裴注·魏略列传","text":"李孚收缚守围者开围驰到城下，以绳引得入邺","evidence":["liusima-q-002859cc25a40bf52b6e"]},{"id":"liusima-a-28aecd85ecef2f77293a","label":"裴注·魏略列传","text":"审配等见孚悲喜鼓噪称万岁，太祖笑谓孚方且复得出","evidence":["liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0035","role":"答尚今使小人往恐不足以知外内且恐不能自达，请自往；闻邺围甚坚多人则觉，以为直当将三骑足矣；自选温信者三人，不语所之，皆敕使具脯粮不得持兵杖，各给快马；辞尚来南，所在止亭传；及到梁淇，使从者斫问事杖三十枚系著马边，自著平上帻，将三骑，投暮诣邺下；因刍牧者多夜到，以鼓一中自称都督，历北围循表而东，从东围表又循围而南，步步呵责守围将士，随轻重行其罚；历太祖营前径南过，从南围角西折当章门，复责怒守围者收缚之，因开其围驰到城下，呼城上人，城上人以绳引得入；得入邺城","evidence":["liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c","liusima-q-9aba3f6aab70ac54b164","liusima-q-b95e43771dc2d45e3569","liusima-q-002859cc25a40bf52b6e","liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"问孚当何所得，从其计","evidence":["liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c"]},{"person":"wudi-p0208","role":"等见孚悲喜，鼓噪称万岁","evidence":["liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"守围者以状闻，笑曰此非徒得入也，方且复得出","evidence":["liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c","liusima-q-9aba3f6aab70ac54b164","liusima-q-b95e43771dc2d45e3569","liusima-q-002859cc25a40bf52b6e","liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c","source_order":[15,301,149],"order":3369}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liusima-p0035","name":"李孚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0198","name":"袁尚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0208","name":"审配","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-002859cc25a40bf52b6e","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"遂历太祖营前，径南过；从南围角西折，当章门；复责怒守围者，收缚之。因开其围，驰到城下，呼城上人；城上人以绳引，孚得入","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":378,"end":436,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-65dbd6014bf55c99760c","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"孚答尚言：‘今使小人往，恐不足以知外内；且恐不能自达。孚请自往！’尚问孚：‘当何所得？’孚曰：‘闻邺围甚坚，多人则觉。以为直当将三骑，足矣","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":149,"end":218,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-9aba3f6aab70ac54b164","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"遂辞尚来南，所在止亭传。及到梁淇，使从者斫问事杖三十枚，系著马边；自著平上帻，将三骑，投暮诣邺下","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":257,"end":305,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-a06af0d1ddff1aa9457e","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"配等见孚，悲喜，鼓噪称‘万岁’。守围者以状闻，太祖笑曰：‘此非徒得入也，方且复得出","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":437,"end":478,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-b95e43771dc2d45e3569","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-2fb260215c97884ad3d8","layer":"pei","quote":"是时，大将军虽有禁令，而刍牧者多，故孚因此夜到。以鼓一中，自称‘都督’；历北围，循表而东；从东围表，又循围而南；步步呵责守围将士，随轻重行其罚","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":306,"end":377,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
